/*  hole-11-33049.cufe: the model says some run reaches freed memory; `check` accepts it.
    chance true: same; chance false: CRASH 0xc0000005  */

Define chance as true permanently.
Bind series of number to f0, given (the series of number p0, the series of number p1):
    p1 becomes p0.
    Insert 5 into p0.
    Insert 5 into p1.
    p0 becomes a series of number.
    Return p0.
Done.
Pull a rabbit.
    Pull a rabbit.
        Define v1 as a series of number.
    Done.
Done.
Define v2 as a series of number.
Define v3 as a series of number.
Cast f0 on (v2, v2).
Pull a rabbit.
    If chance:
        If chance:
            Define v4 as v2.
        Done.
        Otherwise:
            Define v5 as cast f0 on (v2, v3).
        Done.
    Done.
    Otherwise:
        v3 becomes cast f0 on (v2, v3).
    Done.
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State v2.
State v3.
